  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are at your most powerful when clothed in the forms of beasts.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Shaping Focus<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your effective druid level is increased by your mythic tier for all purposes related to your wild shape ability. In addition you may spend a number of uses of mythic power up to half your tier to further increase your effective druid level by that amount for the purpose of wild shape.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc52\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
